message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "PARC: Adaptive Predictive Location Updating in Mobile Computing Networks"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code and results for four classical location update strategies
  (time-, distance-, movement- and profile-based) and two proposed algorithms
  (PARC and the hybrid PARC-H), evaluated over 560 paired per-subscriber
  observations on a 127-cell hexagonal mesh.
